 "<b>Macrogotero</b>: 20 gotas = 1 mL<br><b>Microgotero</b>: 60 gotas = 1 mL": "<b>Makrotantakaria</b>: 20 tanta = 1 mL<br><b>Mikrotantakaria</b>: 60 tanta = 1 mL",
